DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The oowwtteemmpp driver provides support for the 1-Wire temperature sensor.
     The sensor possesses a single temperature value that can be accessed
     through the sysctl(8) interface.

     The following chips are supported by the driver:

           ••   Maxim/Dallas DS1820/DS18B20/DS18S20/DS1822
           ••   Maxim/Dallas DS1920

